(33,63,"The family of 'Imran","The birth of Maryam, Zakariyya's prayer, the birth of 'Isa, his miracles, and the mubahalah."),
(64,101,"A common word","An invitation to the People of the Book. Ibrahim was neither Jew nor Christian. The first House of worship is in Makkah."),
